# GENERATED by make-turn-driver.py from efast2.py on every build turn; edits here are lost. Change make-turn-driver.py.
"""Candidate-E restart controller (JJ's "toggle off what doesn't work"). Caller (efast2-turn.sh) holds both GPU locks,
rank1-host first, for the whole run. For each config: boot E (slot D) with E's flags plus that config's overrides, on the
K6 pack (arms-ehx base) or the K4 pack (arms-ek4 base: H's prepared identity, nothing re-prepared); gates as efast.py
(smoke, strict tools, greedy 2K = H 7538b205…, 8K cell = H's IDs); then e-driver.py (Tony's method, 1 warmup +
3 reps, ACCEPT_LOG) with apt paused; then serve. While serving it polls out/<run>/NEXT.json
({"name": ..., "pack": "k6"|"k4", "extra": ["KEY=V", ...]}): stop, restart with that config, gate, measure, serve.
out/<run>/STOP ends it (ranks cancelled, holds and foreign jobs restored).
Usage: [EF_SHA=<slot-D sha>] [EF_BASE=<K6 base label, default ehx>] efast2.py <run_id> <first-config.json>   Status in out/<run_id>/status.json; one dir per config."""

